CM_ "Fiat Punto 188 (Mk2) 1.2 8V Fire — B-CAN 50 kbps, 11-bit IDs, listen-only reverse engineered 2026-11-21/22, ESP32-S3 + OBD-II K-Line cross-check. Transmitters not asserted (Vector__XXX throughout). 0x0C6/0x0C7 intentionally excluded: UDS-style visitors, suspected diagnostic-tool traffic, never native. Open items: 0DD.b4 exact law (load proxy, r~0.84 vs 0104), 0E5.b3 fast unknown byte, fuel scale +-5 pending brim fill, warning-lamp bits (all dark bytes) pending key-on bulb-check capture.";

